[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14941.59, "timestamp": "04:09:01", "text": "就像 YouTube 一样。是的，我想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14945.75, "timestamp": "04:09:05", "text": "使其相等。我想让它趋于平衡。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14948.07, "timestamp": "04:09:08", "text": "我不应该只看推特的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14956.55, "timestamp": "04:09:16", "text": "所以，我在Twitch上有七个……等等，我有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14959.75, "timestamp": "04:09:19", "text": "470个粉丝，对吧？所以，我到底想说什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14962.07, "timestamp": "04:09:22", "text": "我想做的就是开始更加专注。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14965.349, "timestamp": "04:09:25", "text": "当我拿到我的 YouTube 频道时，我会在 Twitch 上直播。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14970.309, "timestamp": "04:09:30", "text": "到 740 7 号，没有 470。我想让它相等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14972.79, "timestamp": "04:09:32", "text": "平等的。我不想像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14974.95, "timestamp": "04:09:34", "text": "这不平衡，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14977.67, "timestamp": "04:09:37", "text": "是的，我想让它平等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14980.79, "timestamp": "04:09:40", "text": "然后有一天，在一个美好的日子里，就那么一天。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14983.91, "timestamp": "04:09:43", "text": "2023年或2024年，总有一天，如果有人知道该怎么做的话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14986.63, "timestamp": "04:09:46", "text": "然而，我不知道有一天我是否会……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14989.67, "timestamp": "04:09:49", "text": "能够在 Billy Billy 上进行流媒体播放"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14993.189, "timestamp": "04:09:53", "text": "我们也会尽全力努力工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14996.229, "timestamp": "04:09:56", "text": "华人社区也喜欢制作"}]